def is_balanced(s):
    pairs = {')': '(', ']': '[', '}': '{'}
    st = []
    for ch in s:
        if ch in '([{':
            st.append(ch)
        elif ch in pairs:
            if not st or st.pop() != pairs[ch]:
                return False
    return not st
```

Each character is processed once, so time is O(n) and space is O(n).

